{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/wM0osf4N7AJYolZdyco8dQ?scene=1&click_id=912837394","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:30.446153+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/wM0osf4N7AJYolZdyco8dQ?scene=1&click_id=912837394","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/Lkl5qdVyuibCdwvvXuyx9QgSKQNUQBibxVB5BfOBtKfKOcjBEyMZvrsedS0icTr58PE4NwrH4wkN8ZmsYVLVw7FQzQUJA6952jsaT27XiaISuqc/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>为深入落实教育部《关于加强基础学科人才培养的意见》要求，推进经济学拔尖学生培养，提高拔尖学生的培养水平和学术创新能力，浙江大学经济学院依托</span><span><strong><span>经济学基础学科拔尖学生培养基地建设平台</span></strong></span><span>，拟于</span><span><strong><span>2026年7月6日-7月10日</span></strong></span><span>首次举办暑期学校，为全国高校的拔尖学生提供高水平学习和交流的平台。</span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>内容简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>本次暑期学校为期五天，旨在通过名师课程、实地实践调研、论文报告会等多种形式，帮助学生拓宽学术视野、提升科研能力、增进对经济学科前沿动态的了解。</span></p></section></section><section><section><table><tbody><tr><td><section><p><strong><span>日期</span></strong></p></section></td><td><section><p><strong><span>日程安排</span></strong></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>7月6日</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>报到注册</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>7月7日</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>开幕式、主旨演讲、前沿课程</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>7月8日</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>实践调研</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>7月9日</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>前沿课程</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>7月10日</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>论文报告会、闭幕式</span></p></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section><section><p><span>（以上日程为初步安排，具体日程安排以报到时发放的相关材料为准）</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>招收计划</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>1.招收对象：</span></span></strong><span>对经济学研究有浓厚兴趣、具备良好科研潜质的全国高校“拔尖计划2.0”经济学基地学生及相关专业优秀学生</span></p><p><strong><span><span>2.招收人数：</span></span></strong><span>30人</span></p><p><strong><span><span>3.学员待遇：</span></span></strong><span>免收学费，学院提供暑校期间单人间住宿，并按高铁二等座标准实报实销往返交通费（上限1000元），超出部分及活动期间个人饮食等消费由学员自理</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1.本次暑期学校采取</span><strong><span><span>线上扫码</span></span></strong><span>报名方式。请有意向的学生扫描下方二维码填写报名信息。</span></p><p><span>报名截止时间：</span><strong><span><span>2026年6月20日</span></span></strong></p><p><span>录取通知时间：2026年6月26日前，录取结果将以短信或邮件形式通知</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Lkl5qdVyuibBDQDYFOmm0PoO3iav1qosmq2WzslCm1lbdS6l5dtX7evvGJlVQeh43cb6fibDDLA2FENejXxtxRtibnqnDWrkOTcnsCdvKO2dLyc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>2.有意向在论文报告会环节汇报论文的同学，请在报名时按要求上传个人学术论文。经评选成功入选并参加汇报的同学，将有机会获得奖励证明。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>四</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section